  "description_text": "Discover this charming 3-bedroom, 1.5-bath brick ranch in Chicago's Washington Heights neighborhood! Completely rehabbed in 2021, this move-in-ready home offers comfort, character, and convenience, ideal for first-time homebuyers or investors seeking a solid South Side opportunity. Step inside to a welcoming living room, beautiful hardwood floors, and a functional layout designed for everyday living. Enjoy central air conditioning and a full appliance package, including a stove, refrigerator, microwave, washer, and dryer. Outside, you'll find a spacious backyard perfect for entertaining, a covered patio, and a detached 2-car garage featuring an additional overhead door with backyard access. Situated on a quiet residential block, just minutes from I-57, shopping centers, grocery stores, coffee shops, restaurants, and Home Depot. Move right in and make it your own! Schedule your showing today!",
